{"step_index":155,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-23T16:26:24Z","model":"gemini-3.8-flash-high","input_tokens":3640,"cache_read_tokens":79389,"output_tokens":1778,"thinking":"Building UI components. The `PromotionModal` requires a clean modal design, displaying Queen, Rook, Bishop, and Knight pieces with hover effects and dark glassmorphic styling. The `ChessboardContainer` will feature subtle cyan highlighting for the selected square and visual indicators for legal moves: circular dots for empty squares and ring/corner brackets for capture squares.\n\n\nLast move will be indicated with a soft indigo highlight. Check situations will trigger a red glowing radial pulse on the king's square. Hint moves will be highlighted in emerald green. Additional components are being designed for controls (new game, undo, hint, flip board, sound toggle), player cards, captured pieces, move history, and difficulty selection. Board styling will feature a charcoal/slate wood theme with a subtle cyan glow on the outer frame.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import React from 'react';\nimport { PieceSymbol, Color } from 'chess.js';\nimport { motion, AnimatePresence } from 'framer-motion';\n\ninterface PromotionModalProps {\n  isOpen: boolean;\n  color: Color;\n  onSelect: (piece: PieceSymbol) => void;\n  onCancel: () => void;\n}\n\nconst PIECES: { type: PieceSymbol; label: string; symbol: { w: string; b: string } }[] = [\n  { type: 'q', label: 'Queen', symbol: { w: '♕', b: '♛' } },\n  { type: 'r', label: 'Rook', symbol: { w: '♖', b: '♜' } },\n  { type: 'b', label: 'Bishop', symbol: { w: '♗', b: '♝' } },\n  { type: 'n', label: 'Knight', symbol: { w: '♘', b: '♞' } },\n];\n\nexport const PromotionModal: React.FC<PromotionModalProps> = ({\n  isOpen,\n  color,\n  onSelect,\n  onCancel,\n}) => {\n  if (!isOpen) return null;\n\n  return (\n    <AnimatePresence>\n      <div className=\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-4\">\n        <motion.div\n          initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 15 }}\n          animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1, y: 0 }}\n          exit={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.9, y: 15 }}\n          transition={{ duration: 0.18, ease: 'easeOut' }}\n          className=\"bg-charcoal-800 border border-slate-700/80 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-6 max-w-sm w-full text-center\"\n        >\n          <h3 className=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-100 mb-1\">Pawn Promotion</h3>\n          <p className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 mb-5\">Select a piece to promote your pawn:</p>\n\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-5\">\n            {PIECES.map(({ type, label, symbol }) => (\n              <button\n                key={type}\n                onClick={() => onSelect(type)}\n                className=\"group flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-3 rounded-xl bg-charcoal-700/70 hover:bg-cyan-500/20 border border-slate-600/50 hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all duration-150 transform hover:-translate-y-1 focus:outline-none\"\n              >\n                <span className=\"text-4xl select-none group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\">\n                  {color === 'w' ? symbol.w : symbol.b}\n                </span>\n                <span className=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-slate-300 group-hover:text-cyan-300 mt-2\">\n                  {label}\n                </span>\n              </button>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n\n          <button\n            onClick={onCancel}\n            className=\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors py-1.5 px-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-700/40\"\n          >\n            Cancel move\n          </button>\n        </motion.div>\n      </div>\n    </AnimatePresence>\n  );\n};\n","Path":"C:\\Users\\DELL\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\stockfish-chess-arena\\src\\components\\board\\PromotionModal.tsx"}}]}
